        "kind": "handwritten",
        "rationale": "Two eligible buys of quantity 8 share a matched volume of 10, so the canonical allocation is 5 and 5 with no dust. The forgery moves one atom between them: eligibility, per-order quantity, minimum fill, all-or-none, and both side folds all still hold, so only byte-for-byte equality with the recomputed canonical fill vector catches it. Expected fills derived by reading allocate_side: 8 * 10 / 16 = 5 exactly, remainder 0, so the seeded largest-remainder pass never runs.",
